<<<
The difference between sensible of, sensitive to, & susceptible to or of, is roughly that sensible of expresses emotional consciousness, sensitive io acute feeling, & susceptible to or of quick reaction
===
The difference between *sensible of, sensitive to, & susceptible to or of,* is roughly that *sensible of* expresses emotional consciousness, *sensitive to* acute feeling, *& susceptible to or of* quick reaction
>>>

